{"seq":2,"slug":"sim-to-real-transfer","title":"仿真到现实迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems/sim-to-real-transfer","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"仿真到现实迁移\">仿真到现实迁移</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>在仿真器中训练好的机器人策略直接部署到真实硬件时，往往会灾难性地失败——这就是 sim-to-real gap。物理参数的不精确、传感器噪声的差异、驱动器响应的非理想性，都会让&quot;完美&quot;的仿真策略在现实中变得脆弱。弥合这一鸿沟是具身智能工程化的核心挑战之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sim-to-real-gap-的来源\">Sim-to-Real Gap 的来源</h3><p>仿真与现实之间的差异来自多个层面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Gap 类型</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n<th>影响程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动力学参数</td>\n<td>质量、摩擦系数、阻尼不准确</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接触模型</td>\n<td>仿真无法精确建模碰撞、滑动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驱动器模型</td>\n<td>真实电机有延迟、饱和、齿轮间隙</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传感器噪声</td>\n<td>仿真中传感器过于理想</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视觉差异</td>\n<td>渲染质量、光照与真实图像差距大</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境差异</td>\n<td>地面不平整、物体材质多样</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可以形式化为：仿真中训练的策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*_{sim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在真实环境 MDP <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}_{real}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中的性能损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≪</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(\\pi^*_{sim}, \\mathcal{M}_{real}) \\ll J(\\pi^*_{sim}, \\mathcal{M}_{sim})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"域随机化\">域随机化</h3><p>域随机化（Domain Randomization, DR）是最广泛使用的 sim-to-real 方法：在训练时随机化仿真环境的参数，迫使策略学习对参数变化鲁棒的行为。</p>\n<p><strong>物理参数随机化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext>Uniform</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi \\sim \\text{Uniform}(\\xi_{min}, \\xi_{max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Uniform</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.046em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.046em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常见随机化维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>质量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∼</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.8</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\sim [0.8m_0, 1.2m_0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>摩擦系数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu \\sim [0.3, 1.5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>关节阻尼：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∼</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.5</mn><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2.0</mn><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\sim [0.5d_0, 2.0d_0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>驱动器延迟：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t \\sim [0, 20\\text{ms}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>外力扰动：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{ext} \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma_F^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>视觉域随机化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>纹理随机化：物体和背景的颜色/纹理随机替换</li>\n<li>光照随机化：位置、强度、色温的随机组合</li>\n<li>相机参数：位姿、焦距、噪声的小幅扰动</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自动域随机化（ADR）</strong>：从窄分布开始，当策略在当前分布上表现足够好时自动扩大参数范围，实现课程式的难度递增。</p>\n<h3 id=\"系统辨识\">系统辨识</h3><p>与域随机化的&quot;以宽制偏&quot;策略相反，系统辨识（System Identification）试图精确估计真实环境参数以缩小仿真与现实的差距：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>ξ</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\xi} = \\arg\\min_\\xi \\sum_t \\|s_{real}^t - f_{sim}(s^{t-1}, a^{t-1}; \\xi)\\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>方法分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>离线辨识</strong>：收集真实数据后批量优化参数（最小二乘、贝叶斯优化）</li>\n<li><strong>在线自适应</strong>：策略执行过程中实时估计并适应环境参数</li>\n<li><strong>可微仿真器辨识</strong>：利用可微物理引擎直接梯度优化参数</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>RMA（Rapid Motor Adaptation）</strong> 架构将自适应嵌入策略本身：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;本体感知历史&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;环境编码器&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;环境嵌入 z&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;当前观测 o_t&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;策略网络&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;动作 a_t&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"本体感知历史\"] --&gt; B[\"环境编码器\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"环境嵌入 z\"]\n    D[\"当前观测 o_t\"] --&gt; E[\"策略网络\"]\n    C --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"动作 a_t\"]</pre><p>训练时用 privileged 信息（真实物理参数）教 student 网络，部署时 student 仅从本体感知历史中隐式推断环境特性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"仿真平台对比\">仿真平台对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>物理引擎</th>\n<th>GPU 并行</th>\n<th>可微分</th>\n<th>渲染质量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Isaac Lab (NVIDIA)</td>\n<td>PhysX 5</td>\n<td>是 (4096+)</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>高 (RTX)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MuJoCo (DeepMind)</td>\n<td>自研</td>\n<td>MJX (JAX)</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PyBullet</td>\n<td>Bullet</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drake (TRI)</td>\n<td>自研</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Genesis (2025)</td>\n<td>多引擎</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Isaac Lab</strong> 在 2025 年成为事实标准，支持在单块 GPU 上并行仿真数千机器人实例，将训练时间从数天压缩到数小时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"渐进式迁移策略\">渐进式迁移策略</h3><p>sim-to-real 不是一步完成的，实践中常采用渐进方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Stage 1 — 纯仿真</strong>：在理想化仿真中训练基础策略</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 2 — 域随机化</strong>：逐步增大参数范围，获得鲁棒策略</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 3 — 仿真微调</strong>：用系统辨识结果校正仿真器参数</li>\n<li><strong>Stage 4 — 真机微调</strong>：少量真实数据微调策略（fine-tuning）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"量化-sim-to-real-gap\">量化 Sim-to-Real Gap</h3><p>评估迁移效果的指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Reality Gap Score</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 1 - J_{real}/J_{sim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，越小越好</li>\n<li><strong>迁移成功率</strong>：策略在真机上完成任务的比例</li>\n<li><strong>性能保留率</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_{real}/J_{sim} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>研究表明，对于行走任务，经过充分域随机化后性能保留率可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\% \\sim 95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>；对于精细操作任务，通常只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\% \\sim 70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>，需要额外的真机微调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Genesis (2025)</strong>：通用可微机器人仿真平台，支持 soft body、fluid、cloth 等多种物理现象，仿真速度达到 MuJoCo 的 43 万倍</li>\n<li><strong>Teacher-Student 范式标准化</strong>：先用 privileged 信息训练 teacher，再蒸馏为仅用 onboard 传感器的 student 策略</li>\n<li><strong>数字孪生闭环</strong>：真实机器人的传感器数据实时反馈更新仿真环境参数</li>\n<li><strong>Foundation Model 辅助 sim-to-real</strong>：利用预训练视觉模型作为域不变特征提取器</li>\n<li><strong>零样本迁移突破</strong>：Unitree 团队 2025 年展示了多种极端地形上的零样本 locomotion 迁移</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在 Isaac Lab 中搭建一个四足机器人（如 Unitree Go2）的行走任务。训练策略时实现以下域随机化：质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>、摩擦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0.4, 1.5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、外力扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 10N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。对比有/无域随机化在扰动测试中的表现。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个系统辨识实验：让机械臂执行一组预定义轨迹，记录关节角与力矩数据。使用最小二乘法估计连杆质量和摩擦参数。评估辨识精度对下游控制性能的影响。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：域随机化的参数范围设置面临&quot;窄了不够鲁棒，宽了策略保守&quot;的矛盾。讨论自动域随机化（ADR）是否真正解决了这个问题，以及它的失败模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比 sim-to-real 与 real-to-sim-to-real 两条路线。后者先从真实数据构建精确仿真环境，再在该环境中训练。各自的适用条件和限制是什么？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>sim-to-real 迁移是将仿真中训练的策略部署到真实机器人的关键桥梁。域随机化通过暴力覆盖参数空间获取鲁棒性，系统辨识通过精确建模缩小差距，而 teacher-student 架构则让策略自主适应未知环境。随着可微仿真器和大规模并行训练平台的发展，sim-to-real gap 正在被系统性地压缩，但对于涉及复杂接触和精细操作的任务，这仍然是一个开放性挑战。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"仿真到现实迁移","id":"仿真到现实迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"Sim-to-Real Gap 的来源","id":"sim-to-real-gap-的来源"},{"level":3,"text":"域随机化","id":"域随机化"},{"level":3,"text":"系统辨识","id":"系统辨识"},{"level":3,"text":"仿真平台对比","id":"仿真平台对比"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进式迁移策略","id":"渐进式迁移策略"},{"level":3,"text":"量化 Sim-to-Real Gap","id":"量化-sim-to-real-gap"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人形机器人系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems/humanoid-robot-systems"},"next":{"title":"具身操作与灵巧抓取","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems/embodied-manipulation"}}